# opencode datum

## Overview

**opencode** is an open-source AI coding framework that serves as the primary agent harness for b00t. It provides AI-powered code generation, context-aware execution, and extensible agent workflows.

## Integration

- **CLI**: `/home/brianh/.local/share/pnpm/opencode` (v1.14.18+)
- **MCP**: `b00t-mcp` registered as MCP server in opencode config
- **Context**: `.opencode/context/` for project standards
- **Agents**: OpenAgent, OpenCoder, TaskManager, etc.

## Commands

```bash
opencode --agent <agent>     # Use specific agent
opencode mcp list          # List MCP servers
opencode mcp add <server>  # Add MCP server
opencode serve             # Headless server mode
opencode run <message>    # Run with message
```

## MCP Servers Config

```json
{
  "mcp": {
    "b00t-mcp": {
      "enabled": true,
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["/home/brianh/.local/bin/b00t-mcp", "stdio"]
    }
  }
}
```

## Available Agents

| Agent | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| OpenAgent | Universal orchestration |
| OpenCoder | Production code |
| TaskManager | Task breakdown |
| ContextScout | Context discovery |
| ExternalScout | Live docs |
| TestEngineer | TDD |
| CodeReviewer | Security review |

